Name Belgium Note - Ypres Military #1


Interactability_Text_Line_0 ATTENTION ALL SURVIVORS!
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Ypres is no longer safe. DO NOT ENTER this area! Ypres is infested with zombies covered in radiation.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_4 Make your way to the evacuation camp south from here immediately to be safe and secure from the virus.
Interactability_Text_Line_5 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_6 The Belgian Military is doing their best to keep the situation under control.

